    <!-- ── AI Music Lab (unified plugin) ── -->
    <reapack name="AI Music Lab" type="script"
             desc="Unified AI Music Lab plugin: Audio2Midi, MidiGenerator, Text2Audio, StemsSeparator, Setup">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[Single REAPER window with a tab per tool, replacing the 4 previous standalone
plugins plus the standalone Setup wizard:

  · Audio2Midi — audio to MIDI transcription (MIROS, YourMT3+)
  · MidiGenerator — MIDI generation from text or seed MIDI (6 models)
  · Text2Audio — text to audio generation and audio editing (14+ models)
  · Stems Separator — stem separation with Demucs (local) and SAM Audio (cloud)
  · Setup — global environment configuration (uv, Modal, per-tool prewarm)

Native gfx UI: no external REAPER extension dependencies.

Requirements: Python 3.11+, uv, Modal account (free tier sufficient for most models)]]></description>
        <link rel="website">https://github.com/frascuchon/ai-music-lab</link>
      </metadata>
      <version name="1.0.0" author="AI Music Lab" time="2026-08-11T00:00:00Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[Consolidate Audio2Midi, MidiGenerator, Text2Audio and StemsSeparator (plus the
standalone Setup wizard) into a single tabbed plugin. The 4 previous packages
are now deprecated stubs that open this plugin on the matching tab.]]></changelog>
